<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"><FONT FACE="Times New Roman" SIZE="2">There are conflicts of interest between us and our chairman, chief executive officer and president, Glade M. Knight, because he is the sole shareholder of Apple Six Advisors, Inc.
