<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"><FONT FACE="Times New Roman" SIZE="2">We will pay a fee of 2% of the gross purchase price and 2% of the gross sale price associated with property acquisitions and dispositions to Apple Six Realty and an annual fee
