SIZE="1">&nbsp;</FONT></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT FACE="Times New Roman" SIZE="2">We plan to elect to be treated as a real estate investment trust for federal income tax purposes beginning with our taxable
