<A NAME="toc26387_81"></A>Investments in Real Estate or Interests in Real Estate </B></FONT></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:-6px"><FONT SIZE="1">&nbsp;</FONT></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT
FACE="Times New Roman" SIZE="2">Our primary business objective is to maximize shareholder value by achieving long-term growth in cash distributions to our shareholders. We intend to pursue this objective by acquiring hotels, residential apartment
