us than loans between unaffiliated lenders and borrowers under the same circumstances. </FONT></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"><FONT SIZE="1">&nbsp;</FONT></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT
FACE="Times New Roman" SIZE="2">After the initial closing of $50,000,000, our bylaws will prohibit us from incurring debt if the debt would result in aggregate debt exceeding 100% of &#147;Net Assets,&#148; defined generally to mean assets at cost,
