<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"><FONT FACE="Times New Roman" SIZE="2">is a corporation, partnership, or other entity treated as a corporation or partnership for federal income tax purposes created or organized in or under the laws of the United States
or of any political subdivision thereof (unless, in the case of a partnership, Treasury regulations are adopted that provide otherwise); </FONT></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:-6px"><FONT SIZE="1">&nbsp;</FONT></P>
