<TD WIDTH="3%" VALIGN="top" ALIGN="left"><FONT FACE="Times New Roman" SIZE="2">&#149;</FONT></TD>
<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"><FONT FACE="Times New Roman" SIZE="2">Foreign tax credits and our other tax attributes, if any, will generally not pass through to our shareholders. </FONT></TD></TR></TABLE> <P
