 <P STYLE="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px" ALIGN="center"><FONT FACE="Times New Roman" SIZE="2"><B>APPLE REIT SIX, INC. </B></FONT></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:-6px"><FONT
